          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "？ Give some possible scores for Krishita in the three rounds so that they add up to give "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "2 3 p - 7 q ."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 2,
          "bbox": [
            0.109,
            0.145,
            0.677,
            0.169
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "？ Can we say who scored more? Can you explain why?"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 3,
          "bbox": [
            0.145,
            0.176,
            0.848,
            0.236
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "How much more has Krishita scored than Charu? This can be found by finding the difference between the two scores. "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "2 3 p - 7 q - ( 2 1 p - 9 q )"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 4,
          "bbox": [
            0.11,
            0.241,
            0.475,
            0.266
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Simplify this expression further."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 5,
          "bbox": [
            0.11,
            0.283,
            0.626,
            0.306
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Example 9:",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " Simplify the expression "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "4 \\left( x + y \\right) - y"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 6,
          "bbox": [
            0.15,
            0.309,
            0.821,
            0.331
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Using the distributive property, this expression can be simplified to"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "index": 7,
          "bbox": [
            0.378,
            0.334,
            0.619,
            0.445
          ],
          "image_path": "images/page_11_equation_7.jpg",
          "content": "\\begin{aligned}4\\left(x+y\\right)&-y=4x+4y-y\\\\&=4x+4y+-y\\\\&=4x+(4-1)y\\\\&=4x+3y.\\end{aligned}"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 8,
          "bbox": [
            0.111,
            0.457,
            0.849,
            0.542
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Example 10:",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " Are the expressions 5u and "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "5 + u"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " equal to each other? The expression 5u means 5 times the number "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "u ,"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " and the expression "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "5 ~ + ~ u"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " means 5 more than the number u. These two being different operations, they should give different values for most values of u."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 9,
          "bbox": [
            0.15,
            0.549,
